<title>HUNGARY: Tesco's Global swings to '96 loss.</title>
<headline>Tesco's Global swings to '96 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result	   1,808 loss  vs    376 profit</p>
<p>    After-tax result	 1,808 loss  vs    303 profit</p>
<p>    Net sales		 11,301	 vs  6,843</p>
<p>    Other revenue		256	 vs     32</p>
<p>    Operating expenditure 11,901	 vs  6,749</p>
<p>    Net financial income	72 loss  vs    304 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	104	 vs    305</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure  176	 vs	1</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income  32 loss  vs     42 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Global T.H. is a food retailer, majority-owned by Tesco Plc which boosted its stake to 95 percent in January.</p>
<p>The figures were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
